Z||000006||Raydar||11-25-2001||10:11 PM||||Phool. Absolutely right.<BR>A couple weeks ago I saw a new member (like 3 posts) get soundly slammed for posting in what was perceived to be the wrong area. (Even <I>that</I> was questionable.) <BR>The thing that really chapped me was that it was <I>another</I> new member (50 posts?) doing the slamming. Hell of a welcome.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><BR>Not that I think having been here for a while gives me any more clout, because it certainly doesn't.<BR>But, Jeez. We're only human, here. Let's cut each other a little bit of slack. Or at least be polite. <BR>Just my $.02.  ($.03, CDN.)<P>------------------<BR>Raydar<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>From the Department of Redundancy Department.</FONT>||||reg||14
